WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.260
<i>In the world of warring states,</i>

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>they told me I was fit to rule the world.</i>

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.730
<i>But here, I was tricked and 
forced to work for the Yakuza.</i>

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:24.750
<b>All prisons and people appearing in this episode are fictional and have no relation to reality.</b>

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.140
Miss.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.730
Miss Masamune.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.070
Any problems?

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.150
No.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.750
I hope so.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.900
The boss is handling this one himself.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.930
If we screw up...

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.110
What happens?

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:55.890
I'll wish you killed me back then.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.910
Don't move!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.670
An enemy attack?

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.950
It's the cops!

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.000
The cops?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.350
What are the cops?

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:07.330
It's a raid!

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.170
A cop raid!

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.810
But what are these "cops"?

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.720
Get 'em!

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.500
<b>Processing</b>

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.150
Number 6859.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.520
Remove your clothes and stand there.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.400
You're not hiding anything.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:31.910
Listen.

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:34.220
You can't take anything in here.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.300
Name: Date Masamune
Gender: Female
Birthday: Unknown
Blood Type: Unknown

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.760
You know that, right?

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:36.870
Go.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.870
You can wear those.

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:38.480
You can stay in here for a while.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.110
Your first day and you 
get stuck in solitary?

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.210
What did you do on the outside?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.130
Kill somebody?

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:49.080
You don't have the face for assault.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.120
Doesn't look like kidnapping either.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:57.030
What, can she not talk or something?

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:59.590
I just don't want to talk to you.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.560
You've got an attitude problem.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.220
I can teach her a lesson, right?

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:13.210
I need to feed you before 
I teach you your lesson.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.860
Eat as much as you want.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.780
But you have to lick it like a dog.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.920
First I'm going to teach you that

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.500
you'll be treated worse than a dog here.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.510
<i>It's not that I didn't know 
anything about this world.</i>

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:38.750
<i>I was simply naïve.</i>

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.890
Bored.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.990
Masamune-sama.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.710
You're dressed like that again?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.050
We don't have any guests coming today.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.290
It's not a problem.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.150
I can see you.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.310
That's nothing new.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.320
I'm always scolding you about this.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.740
And I'm always telling you I don't care.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.380
Masamune-sama, I want to 
talk to you about something.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.810
I'll leave it to you.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.990
Masamune-sama!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.340
Kojuuro.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.670
It'll go better if you handle it.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.430
So why do you always come to me?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:21.340
Because I want you to 
know what's going on.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.590
What difference does it make?

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.270
You'll be able to get by without me.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.570
I don't want to.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.620
I don't want to be asked anything.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.520
And I don't want you to leave.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.510
I'm worried about you,

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:36.390
so I'm never going to leave you.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.330
Then stay by me forever.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.020
That solves everything.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.030
But I might not be able 
to be with you forever.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.020
What could happen to 
take you away from me?

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:53.430
I don't know, but sometime maybe...

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:58.730
<i>Kojuuro, if you were still with me,</i>

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:01.840
<i>they never would've 
been able to trick me.</i>

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.760
Why you—

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.510
I am hungry,

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.330
but that's no reason for me

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.930
to be insulted by scum like you.

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.250
If you still insist,

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.570
It's a waste to use it 
on the likes of you,

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:22.560
but I'll have to draw Yamashiro 
Daijo Fujiwara no Kunikane.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.620
You bitch!

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.530
You think a toy sword is gonna scare us?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.410
Stop it.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.160
You'll lose more than an arm.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:34.890
Boss!

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:39.040
I've told you before to pick your fights.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.510
But boss...

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:45.130
Boss would mean you're 
their general, right?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.090
General?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.510
That's an odd way of describing it.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.440
Miss.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.930
If you'd drawn that sword of yours,

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.080
how long would it have taken to 
send them all to the next world?

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.770
Less than ten seconds, I'd imagine.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.320
You think you can just—

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.360
Five seconds.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.480
Five seconds.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:12.560
If she wanted to, that's all it 
would've taken this woman to kill you.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.240
She gave you double that.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.040
Thank her.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:23.470
Miss, I apologize for their rudeness.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.290
As their leader, I apologize for them.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.770
No, it's partially my 
fault for striking back.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:32.050
It's nothing for you 
to bow your head over.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.580
You're not only strong.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.700
You know your manners.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.340
You think too highly of me.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.790
And so I'd like to ask a favor of you...

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:47.250
Oh, first I should introduce myself.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.860
Katakura Daigoro, head 
of the Midori Gang.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.080
Katakura?

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.030
Are you related to my father?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.360
Your father?

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:58.200
I don't know. Perhaps in someway.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.370
Then this must be fate.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.210
I'll accept your request.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.210
Glad to hear it.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.010
There's an important exchange 
that's taking place.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.630
But I'm uneasy leaving it in their hands.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:11.360
Um...

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.220
Masamune.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.930
The One-Eyed Dragon, Date Masamune.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:20.050
<i>Just remembering it makes 
me shudder in embarrassment.</i>

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.000
<i>Kojuuro, I believed in him simply because</i>

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.020
<i>his name was like yours.</i>

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.330
Let me go!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.790
Who are you?

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.660
I won't let you stop 
this important exchange!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.250
You don't know what they were trading?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.450
The boss said it was something important.

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:44.090
If you really don't know, 
then I'll tell you.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.710
Drugs. They're trading drugs.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.090
Drugs?

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.780
You don't know what those are either?

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:51.210
They're dangerous things 
that make people go crazy.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.700
Trading them is illegal.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.540
So they make good money 
in the underworld.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.290
So are the "cops" government officials?

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.230
And the "gang" is evil, then?

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.860
Are you some kind of foreign princess?

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.070
I can't even imagine what

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:09.420
kind of life you'd have to live 
to ask such stupid questions.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:13.740
Then I was tricked into 
helping something evil?

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:17.990
Who put you up to this?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.620
A man named Katakura, the "boss."

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.250
Katakura, huh?

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.870
Of course, asking was a waste of time.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.880
He's the second in command 
of Katakura's place.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:36.760
If he's turning himself in, 
your testimony is useless.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.590
What do you mean?

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.830
You're going to tell me you 
were behind this, aren't you?

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:44.160
Yeah, the old man doesn't know a thing.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.240
I did it on my own.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.400
I wanted money for myself.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:49.800
You heard him.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.100
Don't lie!

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.400
I was asked to do this 
by the boss, Katakura!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.790
Masamune-san, was it?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.040
Sorry for getting you involved.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.160
It's just my wallet.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.120
This isn't as much as you were promised,

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.170
but let me off with this,

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:12.150
Masamune-san.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:17.900
<i>It was then I realized that 
I was being tricked.</i>

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.860
<i>I'm such a stupid woman.</i>

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.990
It's time for work.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.140
Get out here.

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.400
Number 6859.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.690
Get out here.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.460
<i>I'm such a stupid woman.</i>

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.940
<i>It makes me sick.</i>

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:02.830
Dig.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.580
Keep digging!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.440
Okay, stop.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.560
Now fill it in.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.400
You didn't hear me?

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.950
I said fill it in.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.360
Fill it in?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.700
If he says fill it in, fill it in.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:32.190
Nobody's asking your opinion.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.720
Okay, that's all for today.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.310
You'll be working here tomorrow.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.720
Get back to your cell.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.060
Okay, that's enough.

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.040
Take a shower and get back to your cell.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.820
You'll be working here tomorrow.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.870
Hey, it's Masamune-neesan.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:10.100
I thought they wouldn't even 
let her take a shower with us.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.310
I heard you spent the 
day digging holes again.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.360
The guards must really love you.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:17.820
I'm jealous.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:18.860
Really.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:24.790
I guess Masamune-neesan 
has nothing to say to us.

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.750
Guess so.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.110
What kind of education do you have to go

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.360
through to end up like that?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.550
I'd like to see her parents' face.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.690
What are you doing?

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.260
My parents have nothing to do with this.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.110
My parents...

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:47.290
If it wasn't your parents, 
then what's wrong with you?

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.300
It's my fault I'm like this.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.110
Not my father's fault, nor my mother's,

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.600
let alone Kojuuro's!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.880
W-What the hell did you just do?!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:17.160
Masamune!

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.520
You're in the way!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.980
You hit me!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.870
So you're going to disobey me, too?

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.260
You're only good at 
sucking up to the guards.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.550
Don't talk to me like that.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.060
That's right.

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:48.200
You think you can go 
against us and live here?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.460
I don't care!

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.960
Get 'em!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.960
Quiet!

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.940
We won't feed you otherwise!

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.160
You wanna go without food?

00:14:58.400 --> 00:14:59.800
Shut up!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.510
Hey!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:27.510
Hooray!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:14.520
You won't get away with 
messing with the guards!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.930
I don't care anymore.

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:30.380
<b>Processing</b>

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.080
<i>It's not that I wanted to run.</i>

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.510
<i>There was a man I couldn't 
forgive on the outside.</i>

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:55.010
<i>I just remembered that.</i>

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:04.100
<b>Hanabusaki-chou Ichibanmachi</b>

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:14.950
<b><i>A flower that blooms proudly</i></b>

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:20.410
<b><i>will someday fall and die.</i></b>

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:27.780
<b><i>So if our lives are short and small,</i></b>

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:32.980
<b><i>let's let them burn red.</i></b>

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:39.430
<b><i>Just follow the path you believe in.</i></b>

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:44.390
<b><i>Opening it in your heart's eye.</i></b>

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:50.420
<b><i>Let it bloom proudly...</i></b>

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:56.660
<b><i>A single flower.</i></b>

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:08.970
Hello?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.710
Oh, it's you. What is it?

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.470
Boss, I just heard something.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.140
Masamune made it out of prison.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.600
No matter how strong she was,

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.940
she couldn't have gotten out that fast.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:26.110
Well, they say she's back in Tokyo.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.440
Back in Tokyo?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.590
But why Tokyo?

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:32.190
She wants revenge on the 
gang that tricked her!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.870
Boss, please get away.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.240
What?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.990
If she was going to blame somebody,

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.910
it'd be the cops, or you.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:44.430
Sure, maybe I didn't explain 
as much as I should've,

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.700
but it was the cops who harmed her.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:51.100
And you were the one who hurt her pride.

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:54.200
She's not gonna see it that way!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.050
What?

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:58.950
We've already lost a bunch of men!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:17:59.900
What?

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:01.770
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.910
It won't be long until 
she gets to you, too.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.440
To me?

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:09.610
Go hide somewhere!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.440
Boss...

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:13.570
Boss!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.820
What's wrong, boss?!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:15.940
Boss!

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:18.990
Masamune!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.000
I won't kill you.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.500
Commit seppuku.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.030
Seppuku?

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.820
You're kidding!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:31.380
Do I look like I'm kidding?

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:35.290
But seppuku...

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:40.820
Why did you break out 
of jail to come here?

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.990
Are you seeking revenge on me?

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.490
I told you.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.740
I want you to commit seppuku.

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:49.480
Sure, I tricked you.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.090
I took advantage of the fact 
that you didn't even know

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.400
what the police were to make 
you guard a drug trade.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.340
But is that reason enough for me to die?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.900
Hey, you're kidding right?

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.160
It's more than enough for you to die for.

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.800
I'll forgive you for deceiving me.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.580
Th-Then...

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.970
But I won't forgive you

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.990
for making your men suffer for your sins.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.980
Is that a way for a leader to behave?

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:19.530
You broke out of jail for that?

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:22.470
It's more important to me than anything.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.350
Hey, do you want to work with me?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.170
With your skills, I could do

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.240
even more trades and not have to worry.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:30.410
Trades?

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.140
Those "drugs"?

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.020
Yes.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.480
They make all kinds of money!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.700
And of course, you'll get a big share!

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.880
How about 10 percent of the 
money from the transactions?

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:40.720
20?

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.030
No, I'll give you 30!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.700
No, half!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.110
How about that?

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:46.350
Commit seppuku. Now.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:51.810
Either way, you'd cut 
me off if you needed to.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.350
Of course not. 
I know, I'll make a contract.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.800
A contract!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:00.170
I thought you'd be coming, 
so I had one ready.

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.790
I'll make this clear.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.350
I'm not interested in working with you.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:09.850
Well, I'm not interested 
in working with you either!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.570
Commit seppuku?

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.150
I'm not dying over this!

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.740
You're beyond saving.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.900
Stylish Slaying!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.650
I've been looking for you, Masamune.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:56.150
The little devil girl.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:58.620
You won't finish him?

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.360
I just learned it wasn't even worth it.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.640
Very naïve.

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:03.400
Yes.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:07.090
Kojuuro would yell at me if she knew.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.290
But I'm surprised.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.330
I didn't realize you were sent here, too.

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.770
Yes.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.290
Of course, I'm planning on going back.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.290
And I need the secret 
treasures to do that.

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:20.900
I see.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.740
That's why you're looking for me.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:25.300
Will you give me your secret treasure?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.300
If I say no?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.850
I'll take it by force.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.060
Not now.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.850
I may have made too much of a mess

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.030
trying to locate him.

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:45.200
Hey, are you running?

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.900
I'm not running.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:48.780
I'm just going to look for Kojuuro.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.320
And I'm sure if we're going to fight,

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:54.800
you'd rather fight somewhere 
we won't be disturbed, right?

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.040
True.

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:01.300
Masamune, we can pick up our fight later.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:05.300
I guess it's time for me to go, too.

00:23:45.720 --> 00:23:46.690
What?

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:49.240
The star of the next episode 
is Tsukahara Toden?

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:53.120
Wait, you read that Tsukahara 
Bokuden, not Toden?

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:57.000
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Sword Maiden."

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:59.860
If Kojuuro were here...
